OL,3,GNEWSAFormer president of Athletics
OL,4,ANorthern Ireland denies child sex
OL,5,Aoffences
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former president of Athletics
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland has pleaded not guilty
OL,9,Fto two child sex offences, including
OL,10,Fengaging in sexual activity with a
OL,11,Fchild and sexual touching of a child.
OL,13,FGerry Carson, 84, from Kingsway,
OL,14,FDunmurry in County Antrim, appeared at
OL,15,FBelfast Crown Court on Thursday.
OL,17,FAt the hearing, Carson pleaded guilty
OL,18,Fto two counts of stalking.
OL,20,FThe judge said a trial will take place
OL,21,Fon the 30 November and should last
OL,22,Faround two to three days.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
